The '''pirate market''',<ref name="SC 102 EG">{{SW|url=series/skeleton-crew/season-1-episode-2-episode-guide|text="Way, Way Out Past the Barrier" Episode Guide &#124; Star Wars: Skeleton Crew}}</ref> also known as '''Starport Borgo bazaar''',<ref name="Melna">{{Databank|melna|Melna}}</ref> was a market located on [[Borgo Prime]], an [[asteroid]] infamous for criminal and [[pirate]] activity. The market was full of so-called<ref name="SC 102" /> kiosks,<ref name="SC 102 AD">{{SkeletonCrew|Way, Way Out Past the Barrier}}</ref> including a [[Unidentified noodle bar|noodle bar]], a [[Unidentified pet store|pet store]], and a provisional [[medcenter]].<ref name="SC 102" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The [[pirate]] market first appeared in the live-action television series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', making its [[canon]]ical debut in the second episode, titled "[[Way, Way Out Past the Barrier]],"<ref name="SC 102" /> which premiered on [[December 2]], [[2024]].<ref name="Premiere">{{Twitter|StarWars|status/1861409832349172011|[[Star Wars]]|quote=Mark your calendars. 🗓️ On December 2, stream the two-episode series premiere of #SkeletonCrew, only on @DisneyPlus.|archiveurl=https://archive.ph/QwMYe}}</ref> Several scenes with the bazaar, however, were previously shown in promotional materials, including the official trailer.<ref name="f19gfOMZTtg">{{SWYouTube|f19gfOMZTtg|Skeleton Crew &#124; Official Trailer &#124; Disney+}}</ref>

